&lt;div class=&quot;yui-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;wiki-tab-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;note&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:110%;&quot;&gt;FILED UNDER DOCUMENT TYPE INTRO-155&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:150%;&quot;&gt;&lt;tt&gt;Introduction VRLT-01&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 15px; margin: 30px&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Kumusta, mga kasama ko sa SCP Foundation!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;footnoteref-890502-1&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot; class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;  &gt;1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;So, it seems that you have stumbled upon a certain Veraltanic author page. Since it may have taken you (a lot of) effort to do so, let me introduce myself.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I am a 16-year-old male who hails from Cabuyao City, Philippines. You should visit our place sometime since it&#039;s chill around here. My main interests are science (particularly physics), languages&lt;sup class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;footnoteref-890502-2&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot; class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;  &gt;2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt; and comedy/slice-of-life works, particularly anime and manga.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m primarily someone you can find at my school&#039;s newspaper club; I mainly hang out there, do a bunch of things with friends, get reminded by our school adviser that we&#039;re making a newspaper, write news, feature and sci-tech articles, and then hang out again. So basically, it&#039;s fun.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I have been sometimes called the laziest Editor-in-Chief the club has encountered&lt;sup class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;footnoteref-890502-3&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot; class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;  &gt;3&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;, but the paper is faring well, especially the science and technology page, which I primarily direct.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As for my (hopefully smooth) career in writing for the Foundation, I hope to establish unique stuff, like weird SCPs, canons, and GoI Formats, while I try to improve my own writing style and command of the English language.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In any case, feel free to contact me with regard to journalistic matters, creative and absurd ideas, or anything else that will not break my back&lt;sup class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;footnoteref-890502-4&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot; class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;  &gt;4&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;. I am often active on #site19 and #thecritters, while I sometimes hang out in #site34, the Spanish branch&#039;s discord server.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Without further ado, let&#039;s get to business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;wiki-tab-0-1&quot; style=&quot;display:none&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;note&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:110%;&quot;&gt;FILED UNDER DOCUMENT TYPE WORKS-155&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:150%;&quot;&gt;&lt;tt&gt;Works VRLT-01&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 15px; margin: 30px&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;My niche primarily involves slice-of-life works and weird pieces that subtly take on social issues.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;#32;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
