&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Footnotes&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-890502-1&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;1&lt;/a&gt;. &#039;Hello, my co-workers in the SCP Foundation!&#039; in Tagalog.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-890502-2&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;2&lt;/a&gt;. My current focus is Spanish, though I have tried to learn other languages such as German, Czech, and Russian.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-890502-3&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;3&lt;/a&gt;. You see, I work quickly and better when no one is looking.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-890502-4&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;4&lt;/a&gt;. Unfortunately, coding is not one of them. I plan to learn Python and Javascript when I have the time.&lt;/div&gt;
