						 <div style="text-align: right;"></div> <div class="note"> <p><br /></p> <p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-size:150%;"><tt><strong>AUTHOR METADATA RETRIEVED</strong></tt></span></p> <p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-size:110%;">You are now accessing Page-VERALTA-ATHR. Please be advised that non-standard formatting has been detected in this document.</span></p> <p><br /></p> </div> <hr /> <div class="scp-image-block block-right" style="width:100%;"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/a-certain-veraltanic-author-page/glider.png" style="width:100%;" alt="glider.png" class="image" /> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:100%;"> <p>A certain veraltanic package always arrives at the Foundation.</p> </div> </div> <hr /> <div id="wiki-tabview-294547a278b5f2a00fe5751302098023" class="yui-navset"> <ul class="yui-nav"> <li class="selected"><a href="javascript:;"><em>DOC-INTRO-VRLT</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>DOC-WORKS-VRLT</em></a></li> </ul> <div class="yui-content"> <div id="wiki-tab-0-0"> <div class="note"> <p><span style="font-size:110%;">FILED UNDER DOCUMENT TYPE INTRO-155</span></p> <p style="text-align: center;"><strong><span style="font-size:150%;"><tt>Introduction VRLT-01</tt></span></strong></p> <div style="font-size: 15px; margin: 30px"> <p><em>Kumusta, mga kasama ko sa SCP Foundation!</em><sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-31284-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >1</a></sup></p> <p>So, it seems that you have stumbled upon a certain Veraltanic author page. Since it may have taken you (a lot of) effort to do so, let me introduce myself.</p> <p>I am a 16-year-old male who hails from Cabuyao City, Philippines. You should visit our place sometime since it's chill around here. My main interests are science (particularly physics), languages<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-31284-2" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >2</a></sup> and comedy/slice-of-life works, particularly anime and manga.</p> <p>I'm primarily someone you can find at my school's newspaper club; I mainly hang out there, do a bunch of things with friends, get reminded by our school adviser that we're making a newspaper, write news, feature and sci-tech articles, and then hang out again. So basically, it's fun.</p> <p>I have been sometimes called the laziest Editor-in-Chief the club has encountered<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-31284-3" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >3</a></sup>, but the paper is faring well, especially the science and technology page, which I primarily direct.</p> <p>As for my (hopefully smooth) career in writing for the Foundation, I hope to establish unique stuff, like weird SCPs, canons, and GoI Formats, while I try to improve my own writing style and command of the English language.</p> <p>In any case, feel free to contact me with regard to journalistic matters, creative and absurd ideas, or anything else that will not break my back<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-31284-4" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >4</a></sup>. I am often active on #site19 and #thecritters, while I sometimes hang out in #site34, the Spanish branch's discord server.</p> <p>Without further ado, let's get to business.</p> <p><br /></p> </div> </div> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-1" style="display:none"> <div class="note"> <p><span style="font-size:110%;">FILED UNDER DOCUMENT TYPE WORKS-155</span></p> <p style="text-align: center;"><strong><span style="font-size:150%;"><tt>Works VRLT-01</tt></span></strong></p> <div style="font-size: 15px; margin: 30px"> <p>My niche primarily involves slice-of-life works and weird pieces that subtly take on social issues.</p> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> </div> </div> <p><br /></p> </div> </div> </div> <div class="footnotes-footer"> <div class="title">Footnotes</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-31284-1"><a href="javascript:;" >1</a>. 'Hello, my co-workers in the SCP Foundation!' in Tagalog.</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-31284-2"><a href="javascript:;" >2</a>. My current focus is Spanish, though I have tried to learn other languages such as German, Czech, and Russian.</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-31284-3"><a href="javascript:;" >3</a>. You see, I work quickly and better when no one is looking.</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-31284-4"><a href="javascript:;" >4</a>. Unfortunately, coding is not one of them. I plan to learn Python and Javascript when I have the time.</div> </div> <div class="licensebox"> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">‡&nbsp;Licensing&nbsp;/&nbsp;Citation</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">‡&nbsp;Hide&nbsp;Licensing&nbsp;/&nbsp;Citation</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>Cite this page as:</p> <p>For more information, see <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/licensing-guide">Licensing Guide</a>.<br /> <strong>Licensing Disclosures</strong></p> <div class="content-separator" style="display: none:"></div> <blockquote> <p><strong>Filename:</strong> Rawr.jpg<br /> <strong>Name:</strong> glider.png<br /> <strong>Author:</strong> BobMacInnes<br /> <strong>License:</strong> CC BY 2.0<br /> <strong>Source Link:</strong> <a href="https://www.flickr.com/photos/lonetown/2857231494/in/faves-188461882@N07/">Flickr</a></p> </blockquote> <div class="content-separator" style="display: none:"></div> <div class="content-separator" style="display: none:"></div> <p>For more information about on-wiki content, visit the <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/licensing-master-list">Licensing Master List</a>.</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/veralta" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6030962&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609165865" alt="Veralta" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6030962)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/veralta" >Veralta</a></span></p> 
