&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-2718-j&quot;&gt;SCP-2718-J&lt;/a&gt; &amp;#8212; &lt;em&gt;&amp;quot;FUCK YOU - STRONG LETTER TO FOLLOW.&amp;quot;&lt;/em&gt; - Isaiah Henderson, deceased&lt;/p&gt;
